'''Metafilibuster''' (メタフィリバスター, ''Metafiribasutā'', '''Metafilibuster''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Filibuster Obstructa]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].

