|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[A Whole New World|Sub-chapter 1 - A Whole New World]]
|money drop = 6,000¢ - 23,700¢
}}

==Enemy==
Metafilibuster is a hologram of Filibuster Obstructa with nearly identical stats and abilities, the only meaningful differences being an extra million HP, an added immunity to [[Surge Attack|Surges]] and the removal of his [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] trait. With the enemy himself remaining relatively trivial, the true threat lies in the drastically improved support that you must neutralize quickly.

==Strategy==
It's worth noting that unlike Filibuster Obstructa in [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)|Filibuster Invasion]], this enemy may not hit the [[Cat Base]] in [[A Whole New World]] if it's far enough away due to the increased stage width. Otherwise, treat it like its original without the Alien trait.

